% of the time.","Material changes hands for you on d5 and d4: build pressure there.","They win material on d4 and a1: keep those squares defended.","Look for the trapped piece: it appears 2.9\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Amazon Attack","children":[]}